// Scope variants of the accessibility cover banner, for reports covering only
// one of the two certifications. Derived from the two banners in
// ./accessibility-header-banner — which are the artwork as supplied and are
// left untouched — by erasing the words that no longer apply and, for the
// service-only pair, lifting the letters of "שירות" off the background and
// setting them down one word-gap after "נגישות". Same 1600px geometry as the
// originals, so they render in the same band with nothing cropped.
//
// If the designer ever supplies artwork for these, replace the four strings.

